TITLE:: RCMatrix
summary:: Small dense linear algebra on nested Arrays, usable on UGens
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCFObject

DESCRIPTION::
Written without conditionals on values so that the same code runs on numbers and on control-rate UGens inside a SynthDef. Divisions go through link::#*safeReciprocal:: (code::x / max(x², eps²)::): a singular pivot yields zeros, never NaN or inf.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: identity
METHOD:: diagonal
METHOD:: product
METHOD:: frobeniusNorm
METHOD:: safeReciprocal
METHOD:: safeDiv
METHOD:: givens
Rotation mapping strong::vector:: onto the direction of strong::origin::, acting only in their plane.
METHOD:: householder
METHOD:: invertGJ
METHOD:: invertLU
Numbers only (partial pivoting needs comparisons).
METHOD:: invertCholesky
METHOD:: invertLDL
METHOD:: widthMatrixFromFactors
METHOD:: powerAdjustmentAmbisonics
METHOD:: inversePowerAdjustmentAmbisonics
